      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A rhodium-catalyzed reaction between 3-diazoindolin-2-imines and 2H-azirines, followed by treatment with a base, furnishes 5H-pyrazino[2,3-b]indoles in excellent yields. A number of functional groups tolerate the reaction conditions, and the resulting 5H-pyrazino[2,3-b]indoles present strong photoluminecence in solutions, powders, and films."},
